    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 152 of Block 02, con-tained in the Cadastral Map No. 521005, situated in the Village of Katukuruduwatta, within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 545 A - Katukuruduwatta in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Rathmalana, in the District of Colombo, in the Province of Western, re-ferred to in Notice No. 52/0419 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1694/23 of 25th Feb-ruaty, 2011 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 18th October, 2016",
